{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >ABOUT THIS GAME</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Silent Village</strong> is a story-driven psychological horror game where one ordinary day turns into a night you\u2019ll never forget.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You're browsing the <strong>opening chapter</strong> of the Silent Village story.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Silent Village</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play as a teacher who\u2019s just been assigned to a remote village school.<br>You arrive by car, meet the locals, shake hands with the village headman\u2026 and try to settle in like it\u2019s a normal new job.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And for a while, it is.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Morning comes. You go to school. You teach. You return home.<br>But that night, someone knocks on your door\u2014panicked. A child didn\u2019t come back from school.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >So you do what any teacher would do. You go to check.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Only\u2026 the school doesn\u2019t look like a school anymore.<br>It looks <strong>wrong</strong>\u2014like time has been scraping it away for years.<br>The corridors feel colder than they should. The silence feels heavier than it should.<br>And the more you look around, the more you realize something is waiting for you in there.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You came to find a missing child.<br>But you might end up finding something else\u2026 something you weren\u2019t ready to remember.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Gameplay</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game is primarily a <strong>first-person narrative horror experience</strong> with exploration and conversation mechanics.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Atmospheric village &amp; abandoned school</strong> setting built around tension and silence</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>VHS/lo-fi horror aesthetic</strong> (grain, distortion, night atmosphere)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Exploration + environmental clues</strong> (notes, keys, locked areas, details that matter)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Conversation moments</strong> with locals that shape your understanding of what\u2019s happening</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tense encounters</strong> where staying calm\u2014and making the right choices\u2014matters</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Content Warning</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >High tension, dark themes, sudden scare moments, oppressive atmosphere.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3983170?t=1768585316","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3983170?t=1768585316","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3983170/baa485433d31ddaaf57c64879bf2fd692459aa56/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1768585316","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3983170/baa485433d31ddaaf57c64879bf2fd692459aa56/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1768585316","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >ABOUT THIS GAME</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Silent Village</strong> is a story-driven psychological horror game where one ordinary day turns into a night you\u2019ll never forget.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You're browsing the <strong>opening chapter</strong> of the Silent Village story.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Silent Village</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play as a teacher who\u2019s just been assigned to a remote village school.<br>You arrive by car, meet the locals, shake hands with the village headman\u2026 and try to settle in like it\u2019s a normal new job.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And for a while, it is.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Morning comes. You go to school. You teach. You return home.<br>But that night, someone knocks on your door\u2014panicked. A child didn\u2019t come back from school.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >So you do what any teacher would do. You go to check.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Only\u2026 the school doesn\u2019t look like a school anymore.<br>It looks <strong>wrong</strong>\u2014like time has been scraping it away for years.<br>The corridors feel colder than they should. The silence feels heavier than it should.<br>And the more you look around, the more you realize something is waiting for you in there.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You came to find a missing child.<br>But you might end up finding something else\u2026 something you weren\u2019t ready to remember.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Gameplay</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game is primarily a <strong>first-person narrative horror experience</strong> with exploration and conversation mechanics.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Atmospheric village &amp; abandoned school</strong> setting built around tension and silence</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>VHS/lo-fi horror aesthetic</strong> (grain, distortion, night atmosphere)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Exploration + environmental clues</strong> (notes, keys, locked areas, details that matter)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Conversation moments</strong> with locals that shape your understanding of what\u2019s happening</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tense encounters</strong> where staying calm\u2014and making the right choices\u2014matters</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Content Warning</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >High tension, dark themes, sudden scare moments, oppressive atmosphere.</p>","developers":["Ashoud Interactive"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"